+# Testing
+
+`pnpm install`, then `pnpm test` (first run: `pnpm exec playwright install chromium`). CI runs the same command (`.github/workflows/test.yml`).
+
+- Playwright tests in `tests/` run against the real `index.html` on desktop and mobile (Pixel 7) Chromium.
+- The page is served from the fake origin `http://todo.test` using request routing, and every other request is aborted, so the tests make no network calls.
+- Coverage: add/toggle/delete/reload persistence, loading tasks saved before filters existed, each filter's results and selected state, and actions taken while a filter is active.
+- The `screenshot` test writes `test-results/*/todo.png` for visual checks of UI changes.
+
+App behavior: see [To-do app](todo-app.md).
