@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# To-do app
+
+A single static page, `index.html`, with no build step or server.
+
+- **Storage:** tasks live in `localStorage["todos"]` as `[{id, text, done}]`. Add, toggle, and delete save immediately.
+- **Filters:** All, Active (`!done`), and Completed (`done`) are defined once in `FILTERS`. The filter affects the view only: it is not saved, does not change stored tasks, and resets to All on reload. Toggling a task under Active or Completed hides it right away, and a task added under Completed is saved but hidden until you switch filters.
+
+Tests: see [Testing](testing.md).
